<<SetShot "CloseUp_A">>
Prince: Why let strangers sit here?
<<SetShot "OTS_A">>

Munir: Everyone is a stranger first.
Prince: Even trouble?
Munir: Especially trouble.
Prince: That’s risky.
Munir: So is closing the door.
Prince: You ever lock it?
Munir: Only at night.
